RESEARCH ARTICLE
Molecular characterization of breast and lung
tumors by integration of multiple data types
with functional sparse-factor analysis
Tycho BismeijerID1, Sander Canisius1,2‡, Lodewyk F. A. Wessels1,3‡*
1 Division of Molecular Carcinogenesis, Oncode Institute, The Netherlands Cancer Institute, Amsterdam, The Netherlands, 2 Division of Molecular Pathology, The Netherlands Cancer Institute, Amsterdam, The Netherlands, 3 Faculty of EEMCS, Delft University of Technology, Delft, The Netherlands
