Factorization of METABRIC
To discover new factors on METABRIC from scratch, we ran funcSFA on the CBS segmented copy number abberation (CNA) data and the fully processed microarray data. Copy numbers for recurrently aberrated regions were extracted from the segmented copy number data using the same approach and same selection of recurrently aberrated regions as was used for the TCGA analysis. Since METABRIC’s expression data were obtained using microarrays as opposed to RNAseq, we did not need to use voom precision weights. Otherwise funcSFA was applied to METABRIC following the same procedure as for TCGA.
